## 3. Transmission — the token is sent to the attacker origin in the same turn

`GatewayClient.connect` normalizes the URL and sends the authentication frame immediately after the socket opens:

```dart title=lib/data/datasources/remote/gateway/gateway_client.dart startLineNumber=211 endLineNumber=216
