        } else {
          _toolCallRequestController.add(message);
        }
      }
```

There is no `_state == GatewayConnectionState.connected` test anywhere in the chain from `_handleIncomingData` to `ToolRegistry.executeTool`.

## The unauthenticated window is open and recurring

`_state` remains `connecting` for the whole authentication timeout, which defaults to 10 seconds:

```dart title=lib/data/datasources/remote/gateway/gateway_client.dart startLineNumber=48 endLineNumber=58
