The timer is armed immediately after the socket is established and the auth frame is sent (`:220`), and reconnection reuses the same stored endpoint and token, so the window re-opens on each of up to ten attempts:

```dart title=lib/data/datasources/remote/gateway/gateway_client.dart startLineNumber=376 endLineNumber=380
